          "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into wh-2.10.6Upgrade\n\n* origin/master:\n  Locks should one enter if acquired\n  sentinel: catch TimeoutError as well\n  [sentinel] update master address if it changes.\n  One more test for good measure.\n  remove unneeded assertion.\n  [tests] Write some tests to handle new logic in blocking connection pool.\n  Remove unneded code.\n  [bugfix] Implement the connection pool fixes onto the blocking connection pool.\n  fixes the various scenarios where ConnectionPool.disconnect() and Connection.disconnect() were ripping connections out from under the threads or processes that owned them",
