          "message": "python redis-py: Pin pytest to <4.0.0 to avoid fixture breaking change\n\nSummary: pytest made a backwards incompatible change in 4.0.0 that\nthrows errors with how fixtures are used in this library (causing the\nentire test to fail).  This commit pins pytest to <4.0.0 to sidestep the\nissue (the entire setup script seems to be streamlined upstream, so this\ncode should be safe to get rid of if there's any conflicts).",
